<title>UK: Novorossiisk, Ventspils oil ports closed - shipper.</title>
<headline>Novorossiisk, Ventspils oil ports closed - shipper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Novorossiisk and Ventspils, the two main export ports for Russian crude, were both closed on Monday because of bad weather, shipping sources said.</p>
<p>Latvia's Baltic port of Ventspils was closed around 0700 GMT on Sunday.</p>
<p>&quot;We don't expect it to reopen until later this evening,&quot; said a port spokesman on Monday.</p>
<p>Novorossiisk on the Black Sea was closed at 2130 GMT on Sunday due to strong winds and remained closed on Monday, a shipping source said.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5387</p>
